<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About Us | EPR Access Limited</title>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="public-body">
  <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
  <main>
    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Building Trust. Delivering Results.</h1>
        <p>EPR Access Limited is a licensed investment firm providing capital market operations, asset management, and advisory services across Africa.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container two-col">
        <div class="col-text">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Who We Are</span>
          <h2>Our Story</h2>
          <p>EPR Access Limited began operations as a dedicated investment and asset management arm. During this phase, our focus was on building expertise in capital market operations, client portfolio management, and structured investment advisory for individuals and institutions across Nigeria.</p>
          <p>This incubation period allowed the team to refine its service model, strengthen due diligence, and establish early client relationships built on transparency and measurable results — laying the operational foundation for independent licensing.</p>
          <p>Today, EPR Access Limited operates as a fully independent, licensed capital market operator and asset management firm, serving clients across Nigeria and select African markets. Our standard remains the same: protect client capital, provide clear guidance, and deliver results aligned with long-term financial goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-image" style="display:flex; justify-content:flex-end; padding-right:48px;">
          <img src="/images/team/Dr. Femi Adebayo .jpeg" alt="EPR Access Leadership" class="rounded shadow" style="border-radius:12px; width:280px; height:320px; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 30%;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Vision & Mission -->
    <section class="section section-light" style="padding-top:0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="two-col">
          <div class="vm-card">
            <div class="vm-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Our Vision</h3>
            <p>To simplify the path to financial well-being and empower individuals and businesses to achieve lasting financial freedom.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="vm-card">
            <div class="vm-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.59 14.37a6 6 0 01-5.84 7.38v-4.8m5.84-2.58a14.98 14.98 0 006.16-12.12A14.98 14.98 0 009.631 8.41m5.96 5.96a14.926 14.926 0 01-5.841 2.58m-.119-8.54a6 6 0 00-7.381 5.84h4.8m2.581-5.84a14.927 14.927 0 00-2.58 5.84m2.699 2.7c-.103.021-.207.041-.311.06a15.09 15.09 0 01-2.448-2.448 14.9 14.9 0 01.06-.312m-2.24 2.39a4.493 4.493 0 00-1.757 4.306 4.493 4.493 0 004.306-1.758M16.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 013 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>To expand access to professional investment management and deliver consistent, ethical performance at scale.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- A-DESIRE Core Values -->
    <section class="section section-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header stagger">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Core Values</span>
          <h2>The <span class="gradient-text">A-DESIRE</span> Standard</h2>
          <p>Every investment decision we make is guided by these seven principles</p>
        </div>
        <div class="values-grid stagger">
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Accountability</h3>
            <p>We own our commitments and stand behind every action we take on your behalf.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Discipline</h3>
            <p>We follow rigorous, repeatable processes that protect capital and manage risk.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Expertise</h3>
            <p>Our team brings deep knowledge of capital markets, asset classes and Nigerian financial regulations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Security</h3>
            <p>Client capital security is paramount — every strategy begins with protecting what you've built.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Integrity</h3>
            <p>We act ethically and transparently in every interaction, every time.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Reliability</h3>
            <p>Consistent performance and dependable service — you can count on us to deliver.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Ethics</h3>
            <p>We uphold the highest moral standards in all dealings with clients, partners and regulators.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Strengths -->
    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header stagger">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Why We're Different</span>
          <h2>Our <span class="gradient-text">Strengths</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="features-grid stagger">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Disciplined Risk Management</h3>
            <p>Robust governance and oversight, supported by resilient systems and experienced professionals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0112 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0121 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0112 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 013 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Regional &amp; Global Access</h3>
            <p>Our network enables compliant, secure access to opportunities across Africa and selected international markets.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 21h16.5M4.5 3h15M5.25 3v18m13.5-18v18M9 6.75h1.5m-1.5 3h1.5m-1.5 3h1.5m3-6H15m-1.5 3H15m-1.5 3H15M9 21v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h3.75c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Independent Focus</h3>
            <p>As an independent firm, our sole priority is fund management and client outcomes. No conflicts of interest. Full alignment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Subsidiary -->
    <section class="section section-light" id="subsidiary">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header stagger">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Group</span>
          <h2>Subsidiary &amp; <span class="gradient-text">Affiliated Companies</span></h2>
          <p>EPR Access Limited operates through a diversified group structure spanning finance, technology, agriculture and real estate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subsidiary-grid stagger">
          <div class="subsidiary-card">
            <div class="subsidiary-icon">🏦</div>
            <h3>EPR Capital Markets</h3>
            <p>Our capital market operations arm — managing equities, bonds and money market instruments for institutional and retail clients.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="subsidiary-card">
            <div class="subsidiary-icon">🏗️</div>
            <h3>EPR Real Estate</h3>
            <p>Property acquisition, sales, construction, valuation and estate management across Nigeria's growing real estate sector.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="subsidiary-card">
            <div class="subsidiary-icon">🌾</div>
            <h3>EPR Agribusiness</h3>
            <p>Agricultural investments in crop farming, livestock production, agro-tech solutions and chemicals — empowering food security.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="subsidiary-card">
            <div class="subsidiary-icon">💻</div>
            <h3>EPR Technology</h3>
            <p>IT solutions division providing software development, website design, cybersecurity and data analytics for businesses.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="cta-mesh"></div>
      <div class="container text-center">
        <div class="cta-badge">Your Partner in Wealth</div>
        <h2 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:16px;">Join Our Growing Community<br><span class="gradient-text">of Investors</span></h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:36px; max-width:520px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; line-height:1.7;">
          Partner with a firm where client outcomes always come first.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg">Open an Account</a>
          <a href="/services" class="btn-cta-ghost">Explore Services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
